### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### GET all bookings (with pagination & filters)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/bookings?page=1&limit=10&status=pending

### GET single booking
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/bookings/1

### GET all resources
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/resources

### GET resource availability
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/resources/1/availability?date=2026-06-15

### CREATE booking
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara",
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "resource_id": 1,
  "booking_date": "2026-06-15",
  "start_time": "11:00",
  "end_time": "12:00",
  "notes": "Team meeting"
}

### UPDATE booking
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### DELETE booking (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/bookings/2

### Unknown route (404 JSON)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/unknown
